# Audoxidy (Teksilo UI): The value controls shared by panels: sliders, steppers, the VU meter.
# Source locale: `tr!` validates keys against these files.

## Sliders and steppers
# The accessible action that does what a secondary click on a slider or a
# stepper does.
controls-reset-default = Reset to default
# The equalizer's value bubble: the gain with one decimal (the Iced UI's
# `{:.1} dB`).
controls-eq-value = { $value } dB
